WEBVTT

00:01.290 --> 00:02.460
<b>My lord...</b>

00:04.170 --> 00:08.040
<b>You’ve become even stronger, sterner...</b>

00:08.040 --> 00:09.670
<b>and kinder than before.</b>

01:57.780 --> 02:01.750
<b>11 - TO SEVER THE FATE</b>

02:04.740 --> 02:06.450
<b>Jio Graze.</b>

02:11.960 --> 02:13.170
<b>Hero Kanon.</b>

02:13.380 --> 02:15.670
<b>Can you really destroy me?</b>

02:16.710 --> 02:19.720
<b>I’m to blame for having created you.</b>

02:22.680 --> 02:26.020
<b>You really shouldn’t overdo it.
That heart of yours...</b>

02:26.020 --> 02:27.890
<b>...wants no part of it.</b>

02:28.230 --> 02:32.650
<b>I was wrong.
Creating a fake Demon King,</b>

02:32.650 --> 02:37.780
<b>taking his place and dying...
there’s no way that such a plan could’ve worked.</b>

02:38.320 --> 02:42.280
<b>And the price for that twisted justice...
...is Avos Dilhevia.</b>

02:43.320 --> 02:45.200
<b>You, such a sad being.</b>

02:47.870 --> 02:50.330
<b>You never should’ve been born.</b>

02:51.250 --> 02:55.670
<b>If it hadn’t been for me,
Misa never would’ve been born.</b>

02:58.130 --> 03:01.260
<b>You had feelings for that girl, didn’t you?</b>

03:01.510 --> 03:04.600
<b>Become my possession, Kanon.</b>

03:04.600 --> 03:08.430
<b>I am both Misa and Avos Dilhevia.</b>

03:10.770 --> 03:13.770
<b>You’re not the Misa that I know.</b>

03:13.980 --> 03:18.940
<b>How trivial. After all,
I have feelings for you.</b>

03:20.320 --> 03:24.620
<b>You may feel affection for me,
but those aren’t your own feelings.</b>

03:25.280 --> 03:27.660
<b>Those feelings are hers.</b>

03:28.870 --> 03:31.210
<b>Misa is still alive inside you.</b>

03:33.330 --> 03:36.710
<b>Sorry to have to tell you this,
but she’s only temporary.</b>

03:37.170 --> 03:41.800
<b>As of now, there’s no longer any trace
of the personality called Misa.</b>

03:42.090 --> 03:43.930
<b>Just resign yourself to that fact.</b>

03:45.220 --> 03:46.510
<b>You’re the fake.</b>

03:47.310 --> 03:48.770
<b>Avos Dilhevia!</b>

03:51.020 --> 03:51.890
<b>What’s this?</b>

03:52.190 --> 03:57.480
<b>That’s the proof.
She’s inside you, battling with me!</b>

04:10.370 --> 04:12.210
<b>Degzegd.</b>

04:21.380 --> 04:25.260
<b>I’m going to sever your fate,
and take it back!</b>

04:25.470 --> 04:28.140
<b>Help me out, Misa!</b>

04:32.270 --> 04:33.600
<b>Theo Torearos!</b>

04:39.570 --> 04:44.200
<b>Calm yourself, divine sword.
The words of a god are absolute.</b>

04:45.610 --> 04:47.280
<b>Zolye Dypt.</b>

04:50.240 --> 04:53.910
<b>Evansmana is a Holy Sword
that’s been blessed by the gods.</b>

04:53.910 --> 04:59.040
<b>Meaning that one word from
the Heavenly God Father can render it powerless.</b>

04:59.040 --> 05:01.000
<b>You’re late to the party, NousGalia.</b>

05:02.300 --> 05:05.090
<b>It’s all proceeding according
to the divine word.</b>

05:07.760 --> 05:12.520
<b><i>I’ve destroyed every last one</i>
<i>of the sources you shared with the fake.</i></b>

05:12.850 --> 05:16.140
<b>And now it’s your turn, Hero Kanon.</b>

05:16.770 --> 05:20.190
<b>Having completed the mission
of spreading rumors about the fake Demon King,</b>

05:20.190 --> 05:22.530
<b>you will be slain by your lover, and vanish.</b>

05:23.190 --> 05:25.780
<b>That’s the narrative written by the gods.</b>

05:26.820 --> 05:29.070
<b>Farewell, Lay.</b>

05:29.070 --> 05:32.700
<b>All you had to do was submit
and become mine like a good boy.</b>

05:42.500 --> 05:44.420
<b>What a boring narrative that is.</b>

05:44.840 --> 05:46.380
<b>NousGalia.</b>

05:46.920 --> 05:51.300
<b>The fun is only just beginning. Misfit!</b>

05:51.300 --> 05:53.260
<b>I’m going to take everything from you—</b>

05:56.310 --> 05:58.140
<b>Lower your head, servant.</b>

05:58.560 --> 06:01.230
<b>If you wish to speak,
prostrate yourself on the ground.</b>

06:01.230 --> 06:03.270
<b>Where do you think you’re going?</b>

06:03.980 --> 06:06.190
<b>Play with me, won’t you?</b>

06:06.610 --> 06:08.530
<b>Have Lay play with you for a while.</b>

06:18.080 --> 06:19.370
<b>NousGalia.</b>

06:19.830 --> 06:22.210
<b>You should know what it means to feel fear.</b>

06:22.500 --> 06:26.090
<b>Fear? Me, a god?</b>

06:29.050 --> 06:35.890
<b>Right... you spew such senseless, worthless,
and useless words, Anos Voldigoad!</b>

06:36.270 --> 06:42.690
<b>Gods are Order... we are nobody.
We have neither rage nor sorrow.</b>

06:42.690 --> 06:44.110
<b>Gods are invincible.</b>

06:44.320 --> 06:46.360
<b>Therefore, we are not even alive.</b>

06:46.360 --> 06:51.950
<b>Hence, we have no fear,
and only continue to exist as this world’s laws.</b>

06:52.160 --> 06:54.990
<b>Don’t you even have the brains
to comprehend my words?</b>

06:54.990 --> 06:57.080
<b>I said that I wouldn’t allow you
to do just that.</b>

06:59.910 --> 07:05.250
<b>You fool, who dares to spit at heaven!
Behold the sight of a god!</b>

07:13.050 --> 07:19.270
<b>Most of the spells engraved on Delsgade
have been overwritten by Avos Dilhevia.</b>

07:19.640 --> 07:23.480
<b>Without the power of the God of Destruction,
it’s impossible to destroy a god.</b>

07:23.810 --> 07:26.110
<b>Even if you were to once again seize
the power of the God of Destruction,</b>

07:26.110 --> 07:29.030
<b>annihilating the Heavenly Father God’s order...</b>

07:29.150 --> 07:32.490
<b>...would send the world down
the path of destruction.</b>

07:32.740 --> 07:36.370
<b>All things must simply follow my order.</b>

07:36.990 --> 07:39.580
<b>Don’t make me repeat myself.</b>

07:43.120 --> 07:44.540
<b>I won’t allow you to do that.</b>

07:44.880 --> 07:48.670
<b>How ridiculous. To see you, the one known
as the Demon King of Tyranny,</b>

07:48.840 --> 07:54.970
<b>struggling to find a way
to peer into my abyss, and eliminate me.</b>

07:54.970 --> 07:56.600
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

07:57.720 --> 08:00.850
<b>NousGalia, it’s not just that you
have no chance against me...</b>

08:01.020 --> 08:03.770
<b>...but neither can you hold your own
against my right-hand man.</b>

08:06.770 --> 08:10.150
<b>I am deeply grateful to my generous lord.</b>

08:10.440 --> 08:14.910
<b>For granting me this chance
to avenge my late wife with my own two hands.</b>

08:15.110 --> 08:18.120
<b>Go ahead and destroy him to your heart’s content.</b>

08:18.120 --> 08:20.290
<b>Don’t worry about the aftermath.</b>

08:20.290 --> 08:21.000
<b>As you wish.</b>

08:21.250 --> 08:25.290
<b>Ignorant Demon King and evil god-killing sword,
I have bad news for you.</b>

08:25.290 --> 08:28.590
<b>You brazen beings will now know divine destruction!</b>

08:30.420 --> 08:32.840
<b>A god’s words are absolute.</b>

08:32.840 --> 08:36.090
<b>Have you forgotten that you also failed
to kill me 2,000 years ago?</b>

08:40.390 --> 08:42.810
<b>You foolish magic sword.</b>

08:47.860 --> 08:49.150
<b>Die.</b>

08:51.030 --> 08:55.320
<b>Any sinner caught by my Demonic eyes
will be judged by divine flames.</b>

08:55.530 --> 08:57.870
<b>When those flames have swallowed
your entire body,</b>

08:57.870 --> 09:00.700
<b>what awaits you is the complete destruction
of your source—</b>

09:00.990 --> 09:03.290
<b>...in other words, salvation!</b>

09:03.290 --> 09:05.120
<b>So I just have to kill you first, right?</b>

09:09.880 --> 09:12.510
<b>This conviction is absolute.</b>

09:13.420 --> 09:17.090
<b>And now, the Divine Sword Roduier
will deliver its verdict.</b>

09:27.980 --> 09:28.980
<b>Shin!</b>

09:31.440 --> 09:34.280
<b>See, this is a Spirit spell.</b>

09:34.280 --> 09:38.610
<b>So that we can be reunited in 2,000 years.
Whatever you do, don’t lose it!</b>

09:43.700 --> 09:46.410
<b>Did you really yearn that much for love?</b>

09:46.750 --> 09:49.830
<b>But your love was created by a divine miracle.</b>

09:49.830 --> 09:54.670
<b>The moment Avos Dilhevia was born,
your job was long over.</b>

09:57.840 --> 09:59.930
<b>I suggest you confess while you die.</b>

10:00.390 --> 10:04.140
<b>Your sin is not having thanked
the gods for that love.</b>

10:04.430 --> 10:06.560
<b>You foolish evil sword.</b>

10:08.560 --> 10:10.400
<b>He’s not foolish at all!</b>

10:13.650 --> 10:17.450
<b>That was no miracle.
I finally see that now.</b>

10:17.990 --> 10:20.360
<b>My husband is the Demon King’s right-hand man.</b>

10:20.780 --> 10:24.910
<b>His sword has never failed
to kill your words, not once!</b>

10:25.080 --> 10:28.160
<b>He’s never heard any divine words—not once!</b>

10:33.090 --> 10:35.380
<b>There was always love in Shin’s heart.</b>

10:35.590 --> 10:39.260
<b>The love that I taught him,
the love that we nurtured together...</b>

10:39.260 --> 10:41.470
<b>it was never once corrupted by a divine miracle!</b>

10:42.430 --> 10:43.430
<b>Leno.</b>

10:44.140 --> 10:49.190
<b>I’m sorry, Shin.
For making you wait for 2,000 years.</b>

10:49.440 --> 10:53.900
<b>Let’s go get her back.
Misa is not the Child of God.</b>

10:53.900 --> 10:55.440
<b>She’s our child.</b>

10:55.650 --> 10:59.990
<b>So you’ve gained temporary life
by borrowing the Love Fairy’s body...</b>

10:59.990 --> 11:01.660
<b>...Great Spirit Mother?</b>

11:01.950 --> 11:05.330
<b>But even if you were to regain
your memories and form,</b>

11:05.330 --> 11:09.960
<b>a tiny body like the Love Fairy’s
can’t hold much magic power.</b>

11:12.790 --> 11:15.460
<b>Divine sword skills can be used at will.</b>

11:19.720 --> 11:22.970
<b>Please, everybody!
Lend me a hand.</b>

11:24.140 --> 11:25.050
<b>Let’s play!</b>

11:25.390 --> 11:26.720
<b>Let’s all play together!</b>

11:26.890 --> 11:31.850
<b>Diminutive spirits, for sullying
a god’s presence, take your punishment!</b>

11:34.690 --> 11:35.820
<b>Hey, you’re It!</b>

11:35.820 --> 11:36.730
<b>This way!</b>

11:36.730 --> 11:38.610
<b>Follow the sound of clapping!</b>

11:38.900 --> 11:42.070
<b>Your behavior towards a god
is beyond disrespectful.</b>

11:42.280 --> 11:44.780
<b>I shall burn you at the stake!</b>

11:47.620 --> 11:49.200
<b>Lignon! Gigadeas!</b>

12:03.510 --> 12:06.600
<b>You stupid spirits who have
no clue about gods.</b>

12:06.600 --> 12:09.430
<b>You will now learn what
the laws of this world are.</b>

12:14.310 --> 12:15.270
<b>Tithis...</b>

12:18.570 --> 12:21.240
<b>It’s all right, Leno.</b>

12:32.750 --> 12:35.750
<b>Grandma... how...</b>

12:35.750 --> 12:41.170
<b>I did the same thing as you.
Borrowed Fran’s body to come back.</b>

12:41.550 --> 12:46.510
<b>Because there’s something that I forgot
to tell my darling, darling granddaughter.</b>

12:46.800 --> 12:49.600
<b>Don’t worry about us, Leno.</b>

12:49.600 --> 12:54.600
<b>We all love you,
and everyone that you love.</b>

12:56.310 --> 13:01.360
<b>Wherever you go,
that’s where we all should be heading.</b>

13:14.790 --> 13:16.750
<b>Alha Alfrem!</b>

13:21.170 --> 13:24.470
<b>Leno... I thank you.</b>

13:24.550 --> 13:27.510
<b>You can meet your demise along
with those ignorant spirits.</b>

13:27.510 --> 13:29.550
<b>Evil god-killing sword!</b>

13:40.610 --> 13:43.280
<b>So you’re harboring Lignon’s power?</b>

13:45.320 --> 13:47.400
<b>Hidden Wolf Gennul...</b>

13:56.160 --> 13:57.580
<b>How annoying.</b>

14:07.010 --> 14:09.800
<b>Just one divine sword isn’t enough?</b>

14:18.730 --> 14:21.190
<b>You can’t flee from my words.</b>

14:21.690 --> 14:27.440
<b>Just like you acquired love, just like
you cultivated those rumors for 2,000 years...</b>

14:27.820 --> 14:30.320
<b>Divine words are absolute.</b>

14:30.320 --> 14:33.530
<b>Die, evil god-killing sword!</b>

14:33.910 --> 14:36.450
<b>God Slasher, Third Hidden Art...</b>

14:37.290 --> 14:38.040
<b>Hell.</b>

14:40.830 --> 14:46.840
<b>How pointless was that?
A god’s source is invincible... no way can it—</b>

14:46.840 --> 14:48.840
<b>A god is...</b>

14:50.130 --> 14:51.640
<b>What is Hell?</b>

14:51.640 --> 14:54.220
<b>The hell of this blade dividing your source.</b>

14:55.850 --> 14:58.890
<b>That is the punishment unleashed by
the God Slasher on a god.</b>

15:03.400 --> 15:06.230
<b>I believed that I’d failed to slash you that day,</b>

15:06.440 --> 15:08.440
<b>but was it just as Leno said?</b>

15:09.610 --> 15:11.530
<b>Your worthless words...</b>

15:11.530 --> 15:14.780
<b>I would never fail to slash them,
no matter how many times I tried, so...</b>

15:39.430 --> 15:42.390
<b>That Holy Sword has lost its power.</b>

15:42.390 --> 15:45.230
<b>It’s no longer my weakness.</b>

15:47.400 --> 15:51.240
<b>Your combat style hasn’t changed
in 2,000 years, has it?</b>

15:51.240 --> 15:52.280
<b>Hero Kanon!</b>

15:54.370 --> 15:57.790
<b>And now you only have one source left.</b>

16:02.410 --> 16:08.550
<b>It’s no use. I can’t be slashed by
a power-sapped Holy Sword.</b>

16:08.550 --> 16:09.840
<b>Just give it up.</b>

16:11.380 --> 16:14.510
<b>I did make that promise...</b>

16:17.720 --> 16:22.310
<b>To come to her aid, no matter what,
if she were shouldering a heavy fate.</b>

16:22.600 --> 16:25.020
<b>That no matter where she was,
I would come to save her.</b>

16:25.940 --> 16:28.980
<b>Then you should think it over long
and hard once more.</b>

16:28.980 --> 16:34.410
<b>If you destroy me, you’ll never be able
to attain your goal, will you? Kanon...</b>

16:34.700 --> 16:40.290
<b>You sorry hero who kept sacrificing himself
to save the world...</b>

16:40.290 --> 16:43.710
<b>Are you going to sacrifice
your loved one this time, too?</b>

16:44.000 --> 16:47.920
<b>The Misa inside me... she’s...</b>

16:48.250 --> 16:49.840
<b>She’s trembling with fear, you know.</b>

16:53.170 --> 16:56.550
<b>Then... I’ll become... yours.</b>

16:58.760 --> 17:00.890
<b>Did you really think that I would say that?</b>

17:02.100 --> 17:05.140
<b>If you think she’s not worthy
of putting my life on the line...</b>

17:05.770 --> 17:08.190
<b>Then I have no right to love her!</b>

17:09.060 --> 17:11.530
<b>You’re just buying yourself some time now.</b>

17:11.900 --> 17:15.820
<b>Even if you were to defeat me now,
you’d only get destroyed by Anos.</b>

17:16.200 --> 17:19.370
<b>If I’m wrong about that,
then why don’t you just finish me off now?</b>

17:21.040 --> 17:23.500
<b>Right. Is that right...?</b>

17:23.500 --> 17:27.080
<b>Then just as you wish,
I will now destroy your one remaining source...</b>

17:27.080 --> 17:29.670
<b>until it’s completely obliterated!</b>

17:30.290 --> 17:34.170
<b>Misa, this is a move that your father taught me.</b>

17:34.630 --> 17:39.050
<b>Even if he had no intention of doing so,
his fate was trying to save you.</b>

17:40.220 --> 17:41.850
<b>So come on back.</b>

17:44.850 --> 17:47.900
<b>Spirit God Sword,
First Hidden Art...</b>

17:50.440 --> 17:52.020
<b>Heaven’s Fang Sword Break.</b>

18:08.580 --> 18:09.250
<b>Misa!</b>

18:16.170 --> 18:17.260
<b>Lay!</b>

18:19.090 --> 18:21.550
<b>I’ve taken her back, Avos Dilhevia.</b>

18:24.140 --> 18:27.060
<b>A half-source can’t survive for long.</b>

18:27.060 --> 18:30.190
<b>Just as the rumors and lore say,
the Demon King will be destroyed.</b>

18:30.190 --> 18:32.270
<b>You lose, Avos Dilhevia.</b>

18:33.860 --> 18:37.190
<b>What a stupid thing to do, Hero Kanon.</b>

18:37.190 --> 18:40.780
<b>Like you just said,
I won’t survive for long.</b>

18:41.200 --> 18:43.870
<b>And that goes for Misa as well.</b>

18:45.200 --> 18:50.790
<b>Misa, you understand, don’t you?</b>

18:51.080 --> 18:53.590
<b>At this rate, you, too will be destroyed.</b>

18:53.590 --> 18:55.210
<b>So what if I am?</b>

18:56.340 --> 19:01.760
<b>I’ve lived all this time, dreaming of a world
in which hybrids and royals can coexist.</b>

19:02.090 --> 19:06.970
<b>And no way will I ever let the fake Demon King
get away with destroying that dream.</b>

19:06.970 --> 19:09.100
<b>That’s just temporary.</b>

19:09.310 --> 19:15.440
<b>You were born into this world in order to live according
to the Demon King of Tyranny’s rumors and lore.</b>

19:15.690 --> 19:17.530
<b>It’s so not temporary!</b>

19:18.490 --> 19:22.570
<b><i>I have friends with whom I’ve sworn</i>
<i>to realize our ideals!</i></b>

19:23.450 --> 19:27.240
<b><i>There’s a true Demon King who</i>
<i>would never cave in to injustice!</i></b>

19:28.040 --> 19:29.160
<b><i>And...</i></b>

19:30.290 --> 19:33.330
<b><i>I have a father who’s</i>
<i>been waiting to see me.</i></b>

19:34.630 --> 19:36.380
<b>And someone I love.</b>

19:38.590 --> 19:43.800
<b>You little fool. What he chose to do
was to sacrifice you, you know.</b>

19:43.800 --> 19:47.350
<b>In other words,
he doesn’t love you at all.</b>

19:47.720 --> 19:51.140
<b>The kind of love you’re talking about
is tiny, isn’t it?</b>

19:52.190 --> 19:55.110
<b>I don’t think it’s good enough
just to be saved.</b>

19:55.730 --> 20:00.530
<b>To be alive means that I can be myself.</b>

20:00.820 --> 20:03.200
<b>That’s why Lay saved me.</b>

20:04.070 --> 20:07.870
<b>So that I wouldn’t have
to keep oppressing everyone.</b>

20:08.330 --> 20:14.880
<b>There’s no one more reluctant to hurt someone,
and yet he went ahead and hurt me.</b>

20:15.630 --> 20:20.710
<b>And someone like you, who can’t even
understand Lay’s pure, simple love...</b>

20:21.010 --> 20:23.470
<b>...you’re not me in any way at all!</b>

20:25.550 --> 20:27.100
<b>That’s just deceptive logic.</b>

20:53.580 --> 20:55.330
<b>I’ve acquired it.</b>

20:56.380 --> 20:59.000
<b>Come, Venuzdnor.</b>

21:08.680 --> 21:12.350
<b>Did you think that whoever
struck first was the fastest?</b>

21:12.350 --> 21:13.310
<b>Lay!</b>

21:13.310 --> 21:17.350
<b>My Imminent Law destroys all before it.</b>

21:17.770 --> 21:19.940
<b>Keep watching, now.</b>

21:19.940 --> 21:24.030
<b>The sight of your lover vanishing
this time, for sure.</b>

21:24.030 --> 21:24.700
<b>Misa!</b>

21:38.580 --> 21:40.090
<b>Lay!</b>

21:47.300 --> 21:50.890
<b>So you’ve finally decided to play for keeps,
Avos Dilhevia?</b>

21:55.230 --> 21:57.390
<b>But you’re too late.</b>

23:35.810 --> 23:40.060
<b>THE MISFIT</b>

23:37.910 --> 23:39.330
<b><i>The Misfit.</i></b>
